{
  "id": "1CH.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "I Lemkei 21",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jok ucungo wi Israel, man eting’o cwiny Daudi ya ekwan Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Yoab man ni judongomawijo mi dhanu kumae, Wucidh, wukwan Israel ugambre Ber-ceba cil kum Dan: man wudwok lembene ira, kara ang’ei welgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yoab uwacu kumae, Dong’ Yehova med dhanu pare bang’ dak i wel migi: ento, rwoth para m’ubimo, gin ceke gi jutic pa rwoth para ngo? nedi rwoth para penjo gin maeni? nedi ebibedo ni lembaduba wi Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lembe p’ubimo bedo tek kum Yoab. Kum kumeno Yoab uai, man ecidho ndri ndri i kind Israel ceke, man edwogo Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yoab uwodho wel mi kwan mi dhanu ni Daudi. Man gin ceke mir Israel gi dhanu rubanga rubanga man dak rubanga ma wodho palamularu: man Yuda gi dhanu rubanga dak ang’wen ku pier abiro ma wodho palamularu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Lawi ku Benyamin ekwanu i kindgi ngo; kum lembe p’ubimo en e ginmajudagu ni Yoab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gin maeni bedo rac i wang’ Mungu: ka kumeno egoyo Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Mungu kumae, Adubo dit, kum atimo gin maeni: ento kawono, akwei, cor dubo pa jatic peri cen; kum atimo kasegu dit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero ni Gad, ma jaeulembe pa Daudi, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cidh iyer ni Daudi, iwac kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Anyutho iri lembe adek: foi acel m’i kindgi, kara atime i kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Gad ubino ba Daudi, man ewacu ire kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Ifoi m’iyenyo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi ndru mi rundi adek; kadi dwi adek ma jugoi ie i wang’ judegini, kinde ma palamularu mi judegini urubi; kadok ceng’ adek ma palamularu pa Yehova, ma en e thong’om m’i ng’om, man malaika pa Yehova m’unyoth i kieu mir Israel ceke ndri ndri. Ka kumeno kawono pid pi lembaloka ma nedi m’abidwoko ba ng’atu m’uora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi wacu ni Gad kumae, Ani i lembe ma tek hai: akwei, wek apodh i cing’ Yehova; kum kisa pare dit hai: man kud apodh i cing’ dhanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yehova oro thong’om wi Israel; man ju m’upodho mir Israel gi dhanu rubanga pier abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Mungu oro malaika ba Yerusalem kara enyothe: e kinde m’eyenyo nyothe, Yehova neno, man elokre kum lembene ma rac, man ewacu ni malaika mi nyothone kumae, Eromo; kawono wek cingi bedi. Man malaika pa Yehova cungo ng’et lelacam pa Oman ma Jayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi ting’o wang’e malu, man eneno malaika pa Yehova cungo i kind ng’om ku polo, m’ebedo ku palamularu m’arieya i cinge wi Yerusalem. Daudi ku judongo, ma gironyo gonia, gilund gipodho arieba wang’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi wacu ni Mungu kumae, En e an ungo m’ung’olo ya jukwan dhanu? en e an m’adubo man akier dit; ento rombe maeni, gitimo ang’o? akwei, E Yehova Mungu para, wek cingi bed i wia, man wi ot pa vwa; ento wi dhanu peri ngo, ma nia jusendgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika pa Yehova lund ung’olo ni Gad ya ewac ni Daudi nia Daudi idh malu, man egur pemblam ni Yehova wi lelacam pa Oman ma Jayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi idho malu calu Gad uwacu, m’eyero i nying’ Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Oman ulokre, e eneno malaika; man wote ang’wen ma gini kude gipondo. Nwang’u Oman ubefodo nganu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka Daudi bino ba Oman, Oman uneno man eneno Daudi, e eai woko ku wi lelacam, man erum ni Daudi ma wang’e ni ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi lund uwacu ni Oman kumae, Mi ira kaka mi lelacam maeni, kara agur pemblam ni Yehova i wie: ibimie ira pi welpiny ma bo, kara thong’omne ng’ol ni dhanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Oman uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Game iri, man wek rwoth para m’ubimo tim gin m’ubedo ber i wang’e: nen, amio iri koni dhiang’ ni lam m’awang’a, man jambfodo ni yende, man nganu ni lam mi mogo; amie ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo ma Daudi wacu ni Oman kumae, Ungo; ento abing’iewe andha ku welpiny ma bo: kum abigamu maeni ma peri ni Yehova ngo, kadok thiero lam m’awang’a de m’umbe welpiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Daudi mio cekel mi mola ma kwar dak abusiel m’eporo ku jampor ni Oman mi kaka maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi guro pemblam keca ni Yehova, man ethiero lam m’awang’a ku lam mi kwiocwiny, man elwong’o Yehova; e eloko lembe ire kud i polo ku mac wi pemblam mi lam m’awang’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova ng’olo ni malaika; e eroyo palamularu pare kendo i ukorone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nindo maeca ka Daudi neno nia Yehova loko ire lembe wi lelacam pa Oman ma Jayebusi, e elamu lam keca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum hema pa Yehova, ma Musa timo i langa, ku pemblam mi lam m’awang’a, i nindo maeca gini i ka ma malu i Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Daudi copo cidho i wang’e ngo kara epenj ba Mungu; kum lworo nege kum palamularu pa malaika pa Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
